    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20279" root="سكن" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْكَانٌ</span></b> , meaning “ an earnest, ” or “ earnest
money, ” and of which [as well as of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْكِينٌ</span>] the
pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَاكِينُ</span>, belongs to art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مسك</span>. (TA.)

